<title>JORDAN: Jordan's king go on European tour and Morocco.</title>
<headline>Jordan's king go on European tour and Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Hussein of Jordan flew to Britain on Saturday on the first leg of a foreign tour which would also take him to Germany, Ireland and Morocco, the state news agency Petra said.</p>
<p>Petra said the king left with his American-born wife Queen Noor but did not give details on his tour.</p>
</text>
